### Infrastructure Overview

**Resources in main.bicep:**
- User-Assigned Managed Identity with proper role assignments
- Azure Container Registry (Basic SKU)
- Azure Key Vault with RBAC authentication
- PostgreSQL Flexible Server (Standard_D2ds_v5, version 17)
- Container Apps Environment with Log Analytics
- Container App with auto-scaling and CORS
- Application Insights for monitoring
- Firewall rules for Azure Services
- Secrets stored in Key Vault

**All IAC Rules Applied:**
- ✅ Resource naming: az{prefix}{uniqueString}
- ✅ AcrPull role for managed identity
- ✅ Key Vault Secrets User role for managed identity
- ✅ Container App with azd-service-name tag
- ✅ Base container image configured
- ✅ CORS policy enabled
- ✅ PostgreSQL firewall rule (0.0.0.0)
- ✅ Log Analytics integration
- ✅ Required outputs defined

